 If you want to go in, you can -- but it's your life.}
{116}{}{알겠어요.}
{117}{}{좋아요. 저기 큰 집에 가서 락이 보냈다고 하세요.}
{118}{}{알겠어요.}
{119}{}{Glad to hear that you are on the good side in Scrapheap.
